sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant M as main/Application
    participant C as ConfigStore
    participant U as MainWindow/AppController(UI线程)
    participant W as DbWorker
    participant T as TaskService
    participant R as UnitOfWork/Repositories
    participant DB as MySQL

    M->>C: Load(%APPDATA%/TodoListWin/config.ini)
    C-->>M: AppConfig或安全默认值
    M->>U: 创建Win64/x64无边框Per-Monitor V2窗口
    M->>W: Start(数据层工厂)
    U->>W: InitializeAndLoadFirstPage(generation)
    W->>R: EnsureDatabaseAndSchema
    R->>DB: 幂等CREATE DATABASE/TABLE与版本检查
    W->>R: 查询首页游标页/导航计数/统计
    R->>DB: 预编译SELECT与聚合
    W-->>U: PostCompletion(结果在线程安全队列)
    U->>U: 校验generation并更新AppState

    U->>W: SetCompleted(taskId,true,expectedRevision,generation)
    W->>T: SetCompleted(...)
    T->>R: Begin(REPEATABLE READ)
    R->>DB: SELECT task + category FOR UPDATE
    T->>R: Update completed/completed_at/revision
    T->>R: Append COMPLETE history snapshot/event_at
    alt 全部SQL成功
        R->>DB: COMMIT
        R-->>T: 最新Task
        T-->>W: Result<Task>
        W-->>U: Completion
        U->>U: 更新Task并使统计/导航/相关页失效
        U->>U: 播放220ms完成动画
    else 任一SQL或提交失败
        R->>DB: ROLLBACK
        R-->>T: AppError
        T-->>W: Result<Task>(失败)
        W-->>U: Completion
        U->>U: 保留原UI并提供重试/配置入口
    end
